1178:Drivers/lvgl/src/stdlib/builtin/lv_tlsf.c **** ** The TLSF block information provides us with enough information to
1179:Drivers/lvgl/src/stdlib/builtin/lv_tlsf.c **** ** provide a reasonably intelligent implementation of realloc, growing or
1180:Drivers/lvgl/src/stdlib/builtin/lv_tlsf.c **** ** shrinking the currently allocated block as required.
